    <string name="s_about">About</string>
    <string name="s_about_text">The Usual is a diary of the cafés you keep coming back to, part of Stillcraft. No account, no ads, no analytics, and no internet at all: the diary stays on the phone. Photos of café fronts are redrawn as sketches on the phone and only the sketch is kept. Fonts: Playfair Display, Caveat, Manrope and PT Mono (SIL Open Font License).</string>
